OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty life raft from missing
OL,4,Afishing boat Kilda washes up in
OL,5,AShetland
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn empty life raft from the missing
OL,8,Ffishing boat Kilda has washed up 200
OL,9,Fmiles away in Shetland.
OL,11,FThree men were on board the Kilda when
OL,12,Fit disappeared north of Lewis on 13
OL,13,FOctober.
OL,15,FThe body of crew member Douglas
OL,16,FCraigie, 49, was found by search teams
OL,17,Fthe following day. Two other men -
OL,18,FNorman Murray, 40, and 23-year-old
OL,19,Fcrew-mate Murdo Morrison - remain
OL,20,Funaccounted for.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
