OL,3,GNEWSAEmpty life raft from missing
OL,4,Afishing boat Kilda washes up in
OL,5,AShetland
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice Scotland said the life raft
OL,8,Fwashed ashore at West Burrafirth, about
OL,9,F200 miles (320km) north-east of the
OL,10,Farea where the Kilda sank.
